-- Taylor Swift story for 31 Oct 2026: Tim McGraw debunks the rumour that he performed at the Taylor Swift / Travis Kelce wedding
-- Verified from Esquire 'What I've Learned' interview released 28 Oct 2026, as reported 30 Oct 2026 by People, InStyle, Parade and The Comeback (all agree on the quote, the venue/date, and that McGraw attended with Faith Hill but did not perform).
-- Performers McCartney/Nicks and Kelce singing are attributed to People/InStyle, not confirmed by Swift or Kelce. Nelly/Ashanti non-performance per People (Good Day New York, 21 Oct 2026).
-- Not a duplicate: no live Growentix article covers McGraw or the wedding performance rumour.
-- EN 994 words (body incl. table, same counting method as 28-30 Oct); Nepali columns empty per the 2026-10-27 site rule (Nepali no longer rendered).
